<title>USA: Gabelli launches Westwood small-cap fund.</title>
<headline>Gabelli launches Westwood small-cap fund.</headline>
<dateline>RYE, N.Y. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gabelli Funds said it has launched the Westwood SmallCap Equity Fund, the fourth in the Westwood series.</p>
<p>The fund, which will be managed by  Teton Advisers LLC, invests in stocks with market capitalizations of less than $1 billion, using a top-down, or macroeconomic, approach.</p>
